{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "20", "m": "10", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "06", "M": "48", "S": "43"}}, "news": [{"title": "Only 53 of over 2,400 PGs submitted structural safety certificates: Delhi civic body", "para": "In response to a recent collapse in Satya Niketan, the MCD conducted a survey of 2,457 PG accommodations to assess structural safety. Only 53 provided the necessary safety certificates before the deadline. This initiative aims to reduce risks and ensure adherence to building codes. With limited staff for audits, MCD plans to take action against violators next month and is developing stricter policies for older buildings.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/only-53-of-over-2400-pgs-submitted-structural-safety-certificates-delhi-civic-body/135061393?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-205534/135061393.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}, {"title": "NCDRC orders fresh completion certificates for Purab Premium Apartments", "para": "The National Consumer Disputes Redressal Commission has mandated Gmada to re-evaluate the completion certificates for Purab Premium Apartments. This ruling comes after addressing issues related to compensation and maintenance charges for residents. Gmada is required to confirm that all promised amenities are in place before issuing new certificates. Concerns have been raised by residents regarding the certificates issued back in October 2024.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/regulatory/ncdrc-orders-fresh-completion-certificates-for-purab-premium-apartments/135061364?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-101579/135061364.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "regulatory"}, {"title": "Telangana housing minister distributes Indiramma housing sanction letters", "para": "Ponguleti Srinivas Reddy announced the continuation of the Indiramma housing scheme for eligible families in Telangana. The government has already sanctioned 4.5 lakh houses in the first phase and 2.5 lakh in the second phase. Nearly 2.4 lakh houses have been completed, with construction in rural areas ongoing. Despite financial challenges, the minister assured the announcement of further phases for housing.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/telangana-housing-minister-distributes-indiramma-housing-sanction-letters/135061223?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-271616/135061223.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}]}